1
00:00:14,348 --> 00:00:16,266
Baiklah, semua orang senyap.

2
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:18,227
JAM KESEMBILAN
3.00 PETANG - 4.00 PETANG

3
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:20,687
Bagus. Robby nak cakap sesuatu.

4
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:22,773
Ini tak mudah.

5
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:25,734
Kami akan bantu kamu
tangani cabaran ini.

6
00:00:25,817 --> 00:00:27,986
Kalau ada masalah, angkat tangan.

7
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,238
Kami akan catat.

8
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,114
Dr. Mohan.

9
00:00:31,198 --> 00:00:33,116
Farmasi tak berikan ubat lagi.

10
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:36,370
Periksa dengan ahli farmasi,
jika ada di PDS.

11
00:00:36,453 --> 00:00:39,915
Kalau tiada, beri salinan ketiga
pesanan kepada Dr. Nordt.

12
00:00:40,415 --> 00:00:43,293
- Kita perlu penghantar.
- Kami akan buat. Langdon.

13
00:00:43,377 --> 00:00:47,297
- Tak jumpa papan klip pesakit.
- Di sini untuk ubat dan ujian.

14
00:00:47,381 --> 00:00:48,507
Catat nota di mana?

15
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:51,593
Ambil helaian ke katil pesakit,
bukan seluruh carta.

16
00:00:51,677 --> 00:00:53,303
Sama juga untuk jururawat.

17
00:00:53,387 --> 00:00:54,221
Princess.

18
00:00:54,304 --> 00:00:56,306
Mesin faks rosak. Ralat E6.

19
00:00:56,390 --> 00:00:58,725
- Apa maksudnya?
- Boleh periksa manual.

20
00:00:58,809 --> 00:00:59,685
Tiada manual.

21
00:00:59,768 --> 00:01:03,230
Perlah, bawa telefon ke luar.
Jika ada isyarat, buat carian.

22
00:01:03,772 --> 00:01:06,066
Panas betul.
Aduan awak, awaklah buat.

23
00:01:06,149 --> 00:01:07,901
Dia kata, "Perlah." Relaks.

24
00:01:07,985 --> 00:01:10,529
Apa lagi? Ogilvie,
turunkan tangan. Santos.

25
00:01:10,612 --> 00:01:13,448
Ada keputusan CT, tapi tiada filem.

26
00:01:13,532 --> 00:01:15,951
Mungkin sebab mesin mudah alih

27
00:01:16,034 --> 00:01:17,035
tiada di radiologi.

28
00:01:17,119 --> 00:01:18,996
- Biar saya uruskan.
- Bersabar.

29
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,622
Saling bantu. Terima kasih.

30
00:01:21,999 --> 00:01:23,584
Kita kena panggil staf lain.

31
00:01:23,667 --> 00:01:26,420
- Pukul 3.00 hari cuti?
- Saya kenal orang.

32
00:01:26,503 --> 00:01:29,715
Pesakit wanita 32 tahun,
sakit kuat pada abdomen.

33
00:01:29,798 --> 00:01:31,383
- Ada katil?
- Tiada.

34
00:01:31,466 --> 00:01:32,301
Saya tolong.

35
00:01:32,384 --> 00:01:33,468
- Terima kasih.
- Kes.

36
00:01:34,052 --> 00:01:35,178
Santos, Javadi, mari.

37
00:01:35,262 --> 00:01:36,680
Trauma 1 kosong.

38
00:01:38,015 --> 00:01:39,516
Jude Augustin, 12 tahun.

39
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:42,060
Mercun meletup,
tangan kiri tak dominan.

40
00:01:42,144 --> 00:01:43,895
Vital baik. Diberi 25 fentanil.

41
00:01:43,979 --> 00:01:46,398
- Kecederaan lain?
- Hanya putus dua jari.

42
00:01:46,481 --> 00:01:47,941
- Ada bawa?
- Dah hancur.

43
00:01:48,442 --> 00:01:50,068
- Sakit sangat.
- Saya tahu.

44
00:01:50,152 --> 00:01:51,612
Kami akan bantu nanti.

45
00:01:52,195 --> 00:01:53,614
- Ibu bapa?
- Tiada tadi.

46
00:01:56,325 --> 00:01:58,619
Sedia? Satu, dua, tiga.

47
00:01:59,870 --> 00:02:02,998
Jude. Awak tahu
nombor telefon ibu atau ayah?

48
00:02:03,081 --> 00:02:05,083
Tak, hanya tahu nombor kakak.

49
00:02:05,167 --> 00:02:06,001
Okey.

50
00:02:07,294 --> 00:02:09,504
- Nafas baik.
- Abdomen tak lembut.

51
00:02:09,588 --> 00:02:11,506
- Kadar jantung, 112.
- Pakaikan.

52
00:02:11,590 --> 00:02:13,342
- Itu bagus?
- Sangat bagus.

53
00:02:13,425 --> 00:02:16,678
Beri satu lagi 25 fentanil
sebelum kita buka balutan.

54
00:02:16,762 --> 00:02:18,472
Boleh ceritakan apa terjadi?

55
00:02:18,555 --> 00:02:21,475
- Kawan saya ada mercun.
- Fentanil diberi.

56
00:02:21,558 --> 00:02:23,769
Saya nyalakan satu dan terus meletup.

57
00:02:24,269 --> 00:02:25,437
Saya lepaskan, tapi...

58
00:02:26,188 --> 00:02:28,899
- Kami nak buka balutan.
- Saya tak nak tengok.

59
00:02:28,982 --> 00:02:30,817
Tak apa. Pandang saya.

60
00:02:31,693 --> 00:02:33,654
Okey. Sedang potong.

61
00:02:36,698 --> 00:02:37,783
Maaf.

62
00:02:38,283 --> 00:02:39,242
Awak bagus.

63
00:02:42,996 --> 00:02:45,040
Macam lebih daripada satu mercun.

64
00:02:45,123 --> 00:02:48,877
- Macam kena M-80 atau bom ceri.
- Mujur awak lepaskan.

65
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:52,255
- Yang lain selamat.
- Sendi jari empat dan lima pecah.

66
00:02:52,339 --> 00:02:54,925
Metakarpal distal empat
dan lima hancur.

67
00:02:55,634 --> 00:02:58,220
Rosak tisu lembut di telapak,
kurang di belakang.

68
00:02:58,303 --> 00:02:59,846
Luka lecur di pinggir.

69
00:02:59,930 --> 00:03:02,766
Jude, boleh bengkokkan jari?

70
00:03:04,184 --> 00:03:05,727
Bagus.

71
00:03:05,811 --> 00:03:06,728
Teruk tak?

72
00:03:07,562 --> 00:03:10,899
Putus dua jari,
tapi yang lain akan selamat.

73
00:03:11,483 --> 00:03:13,276
Tak guna!

74
00:03:14,277 --> 00:03:15,862
Boleh bius pergelangan tangan?

75
00:03:15,946 --> 00:03:18,240
Saya nak periksa
otot motor dan deria.

76
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:21,243
Kami teruskan pemeriksaan dulu.

77
00:03:24,538 --> 00:03:25,372
Terima kasih.

78
00:03:26,164 --> 00:03:28,291
Dia akan dibawa ke ICU selepas ini.

79
00:03:28,375 --> 00:03:29,209
ICU?

80
00:03:29,835 --> 00:03:32,462
Supaya dapat dipantau hari ini.

81
00:03:34,172 --> 00:03:35,799
Mel, 4mm dan reaktif.

82
00:03:37,342 --> 00:03:40,053
Mel, 4mm dan reaktif.

83
00:03:40,137 --> 00:03:42,597
- Okey.
- Saya nampak tangan awak sikit.

84
00:03:46,935 --> 00:03:48,019
Tutup sebelah mata.

85
00:03:49,354 --> 00:03:50,647
Ini berapa jari?

86
00:03:52,524 --> 00:03:53,734
Tiga.

87
00:03:55,444 --> 00:03:56,528
Bagus sekali.

88
00:03:56,611 --> 00:03:59,614
Ubat itu berkesan? Dia dah selamat?

89
00:04:00,198 --> 00:04:01,700
Mungkin. Mari...

90
00:04:02,451 --> 00:04:03,827
Okey, tutup lagi.

91
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,997
Okey. Apa yang awak nampak?

92
00:04:08,707 --> 00:04:11,334
- Paling atas, E.
- Okey, seterusnya?

93
00:04:14,796 --> 00:04:15,797
Tak nampak.

94
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,425
Okey, 20/200.

95
00:04:19,926 --> 00:04:20,761
Maksudnya?

96
00:04:21,344 --> 00:04:24,639
Bagi jarak 200 kaki,
dia hanya nampak 20 kaki.

97
00:04:24,723 --> 00:04:25,557
Itu bagus?

98
00:04:25,974 --> 00:04:27,601
Ya, jauh lebih baik.

99
00:04:27,684 --> 00:04:30,270
Lama-kelamaan akan bertambah baik.

100
00:04:31,730 --> 00:04:32,731
Terima kasih, doktor.

101
00:04:35,150 --> 00:04:37,652
Saya nak rehat kejap
sebelum deposisi.

102
00:04:37,736 --> 00:04:40,989
Saya akan beritahu Robby
yang saya tiada sekejap.

103
00:04:41,072 --> 00:04:42,449
- Moga berjaya.
- Terima kasih.

104
00:04:46,203 --> 00:04:47,621
- Mel.
- Hai.

105
00:04:47,704 --> 00:04:50,457
- Ada pelawat tunggu awak.
- Apa? Siapa?

106
00:04:50,540 --> 00:04:52,501
- Katanya dia adik awak.
- Becca?

107
00:04:57,631 --> 00:04:59,341
Ya, lesu haba.

108
00:04:59,424 --> 00:05:03,261
Biasanya lega selepas ambil Aleve,
tapi hari ini sangat teruk.

109
00:05:03,345 --> 00:05:06,348
Kesakitan sama sebelum ini?
Sebab sista?

110
00:05:06,431 --> 00:05:07,265
Rasanya.

111
00:05:07,891 --> 00:05:09,059
Saya ada PCOS.

112
00:05:09,893 --> 00:05:12,312
Sentiasa sakit di sebelah kiri?

113
00:05:12,395 --> 00:05:13,814
Hari ini.

114
00:05:13,897 --> 00:05:16,775
Kami akan analisis urin
dan buat ujian kehamilan.

115
00:05:16,858 --> 00:05:18,485
Saya akan beri suntikan Toradol.

116
00:05:18,568 --> 00:05:21,029
Ubat tahan sakit lebih kuat.

117
00:05:21,112 --> 00:05:22,656
Saya memang tak hamil.

118
00:05:22,739 --> 00:05:25,325
Kami tetap perlu uji
sebab dasar hospital.

119
00:05:26,701 --> 00:05:28,495
Kamu masih catat pada kertas?

120
00:05:29,704 --> 00:05:31,164
Ya, hari ini.

121
00:05:39,130 --> 00:05:42,133
Awak doktor?
Dah berjam-jam saya tunggu giliran.

122
00:05:42,217 --> 00:05:43,093
Saya nak tanya.

123
00:05:44,135 --> 00:05:46,304
- Tanya dia.
- Benda ini tak berguna.

124
00:05:47,514 --> 00:05:51,518
Maaf, kami sangat sibuk.
Awak akan dirawat nanti.

125
00:05:54,437 --> 00:05:55,981
- Becca.
- Hai.

126
00:05:57,524 --> 00:06:00,026
- Semua okey?
- Ya, saya sakit perut.

127
00:06:00,110 --> 00:06:01,862
Dah jumpa jururawat rumah jagaan?

128
00:06:01,945 --> 00:06:04,447
Dia bercuti,
tapi kami bercakap di telefon.

129
00:06:04,531 --> 00:06:06,741
Dia suruh saya ke sini
dan Geri tolong hantar.

130
00:06:06,825 --> 00:06:07,993
- Terima kasih.
- Tak apa.

131
00:06:08,618 --> 00:06:10,161
- Saya akan tunggu.
- Okey.

132
00:06:10,245 --> 00:06:11,788
Okey, ikut sini.

133
00:06:12,914 --> 00:06:15,876
- Ikut sini.
- Sentiasa sesak begini?

134
00:06:16,918 --> 00:06:18,044
Ya, lebih kurang.

135
00:06:18,128 --> 00:06:21,006
Wah, ramainya orang yang berbau.

136
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,550
- Ya.
- Awak tolong semua?

137
00:06:24,050 --> 00:06:26,595
- Ya, mari rawat awak dulu.
- Okey.

138
00:06:28,179 --> 00:06:29,180
Bagaimana sakitnya?

139
00:06:29,848 --> 00:06:31,433
Dah tak dapat rasa tangan.

140
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:33,101
Ancef diberi.

141
00:06:33,184 --> 00:06:36,438
Kami akan cuci tangan awak
dengan salina, air garam.

142
00:06:36,521 --> 00:06:37,397
Okey.

143
00:06:41,526 --> 00:06:42,360
Bagaimana?

144
00:06:43,153 --> 00:06:44,821
Tangan lawan M-80.

145
00:06:44,905 --> 00:06:46,823
Tak sangka baru sekali nampak.

146
00:06:46,907 --> 00:06:49,367
Hari masih muda.
Sendi metakarpal empat,

147
00:06:49,451 --> 00:06:50,911
- lima hancur...
- Aduhai.

148
00:06:53,204 --> 00:06:56,249
- Saya Dr. Garcia dari Pembedahan.
- Saya akan dibedah?

149
00:06:56,333 --> 00:06:59,294
Ya, pertama sekali
adalah bersihkannya

150
00:06:59,377 --> 00:07:01,212
dan tutup bahagian tiada kulit.

151
00:07:02,088 --> 00:07:04,716
Awak masih ada ibu jari
dan jari yang paling penting.

152
00:07:09,471 --> 00:07:12,182
- Apa ubat tahan sakitnya?
- Penyekat bahagian.

153
00:07:12,265 --> 00:07:15,268
Doktor bedah tangan mahu
pemeriksaan saraf dicatat.

154
00:07:15,352 --> 00:07:18,396
Deria sentuh masih hadir
pada tangan satu lagi.

155
00:07:21,733 --> 00:07:25,070
Ya, FDS dan FTP
serta fungsi ekstensor masih ada.

156
00:07:25,862 --> 00:07:28,406
- Kita perlu keizinan penjaga.
- Diusahakan.

157
00:07:28,490 --> 00:07:29,324
Dr. Robby?

158
00:07:34,037 --> 00:07:35,538
Nafasnya berbau alkohol.

159
00:07:37,624 --> 00:07:39,793
Mungkin tunggu giliran dibedah.

160
00:07:39,876 --> 00:07:42,045
Orto masih dengan Billings,
kes terkehel bahu

161
00:07:42,128 --> 00:07:44,381
- dari Westbridge.
- Masih membedah?

162
00:07:44,464 --> 00:07:46,257
Dia tunggu sejam untuk diberi bius.

163
00:07:46,341 --> 00:07:48,385
Adakah insurans akan bayar?

164
00:07:48,468 --> 00:07:50,053
Ya. Westbridge masih ditutup.

165
00:07:50,136 --> 00:07:53,390
Bagus. Kalau lambat dirawat,
berisiko jangkitan lepas pembedahan.

166
00:07:53,473 --> 00:07:56,351
Bagus sangatlah syarikat insurans
yang ada kuasa memutuskan.

167
00:07:58,186 --> 00:07:59,270
- Hei.
- Ada apa?

168
00:07:59,646 --> 00:08:02,607
Awak masih tak nak datang
tengok bunga api malam ini?

169
00:08:02,691 --> 00:08:04,275
Ingatkan awak nak datang.

170
00:08:04,359 --> 00:08:05,527
Saya ada rancangan lain.

171
00:08:06,987 --> 00:08:07,821
Okey, tak apa.

172
00:08:08,655 --> 00:08:12,117
Saya cuba lapangkan masa esok.
Tak apa, bukan?

173
00:08:12,617 --> 00:08:13,451
Ya.

174
00:08:18,164 --> 00:08:19,749
Ya, terima kasih.

175
00:08:19,833 --> 00:08:20,667
Ya.

176
00:08:21,292 --> 00:08:23,253
Saya baru dapat hubungi kakak

177
00:08:23,336 --> 00:08:25,380
pesakit obes yang dibawa ke Presby.

178
00:08:25,463 --> 00:08:29,050
Dia tinggal di Arizona,
tapi sedia hubungi adiknya nanti.

179
00:08:29,843 --> 00:08:30,802
Itu berita baik.

180
00:08:30,885 --> 00:08:32,929
Bila agaknya dia akan kembali?

181
00:08:33,013 --> 00:08:35,140
Bergantung pada kesibukan di Presby.

182
00:08:35,223 --> 00:08:37,475
- Entah-entah sama macam kita.
- Ya.

183
00:08:38,935 --> 00:08:39,894
Staf lain akan bantu?

184
00:08:40,562 --> 00:08:42,313
Yakinlah sikit. Ada getah pengikat?

185
00:08:44,357 --> 00:08:45,900
Saya punya asyik hilang.

186
00:08:47,819 --> 00:08:49,154
Dalam banyak-banyak hari.

187
00:08:49,237 --> 00:08:51,239
Ingatkan boleh cuti dengan tenang.

188
00:08:51,781 --> 00:08:54,617
Tuhan menduga hamba-Nya
yang paling cekal.

189
00:08:54,701 --> 00:08:57,037
Dana, ada katil kosong?
Ini adik saya.

190
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:59,289
Dia kesakitan
dan kami perlukan katil.

191
00:08:59,372 --> 00:09:01,082
Nama saya Becca, bukan "adik saya".

192
00:09:01,166 --> 00:09:05,712
Ya, maaf. Dana, Dr. Robby.
Ini... Becca.

193
00:09:06,337 --> 00:09:08,590
- Salam kenal.
- Awak Dr. Robby?

194
00:09:09,299 --> 00:09:10,175
Hebat.

195
00:09:10,258 --> 00:09:12,594
Katil Pusat 7 kosong.
Kamu nak apa-apa?

196
00:09:12,677 --> 00:09:13,678
Tak apa.

197
00:09:17,515 --> 00:09:18,683
Becca, mari sini.

198
00:09:20,268 --> 00:09:22,437
Ikut saya. Kita masuk ke sini.

199
00:09:24,481 --> 00:09:28,109
Okey, awak perlu tukar baju
dan pakai gaun hospital,

200
00:09:28,193 --> 00:09:29,694
yang patut ada di atas katil.

201
00:09:29,778 --> 00:09:32,489
Kemudian, kami periksa
dan ambil sejarah pesakit.

202
00:09:32,572 --> 00:09:35,909
Ada banyak soalan akan ditanya.

203
00:09:35,992 --> 00:09:39,412
- Kemudian, periksa badan.
- Mel, saya pernah jumpa doktor.

204
00:09:41,289 --> 00:09:42,373
Ya. Maaf.

205
00:09:42,832 --> 00:09:45,376
Saya hanya nak awak
dirawat dengan betul.

206
00:09:49,881 --> 00:09:51,466
Awak tak perlu jawab?

207
00:09:51,549 --> 00:09:53,843
Tak, hanya penggera
untuk ingatkan saya

208
00:09:53,927 --> 00:09:56,304
tentang mesyuarat penting
15 minit lagi.

209
00:09:56,387 --> 00:09:57,931
Awak perlu pergi?

210
00:09:59,224 --> 00:10:01,059
Mari periksa awak dulu, okey?

211
00:10:01,142 --> 00:10:03,520
Tukar gaun dan saya akan tunggu.

212
00:10:03,603 --> 00:10:04,437
Okey.

213
00:10:06,272 --> 00:10:07,107
Okey.

214
00:10:17,867 --> 00:10:19,911
Hadiah utama awak.

215
00:10:20,995 --> 00:10:23,873
Duit berkepuk-kepuk, sayang!

216
00:10:25,083 --> 00:10:26,209
Main tipu.

217
00:10:27,168 --> 00:10:29,504
Awak fikir saya tak tahu
awak dapat maklumat

218
00:10:29,587 --> 00:10:30,922
daripada Rose di Westbridge?

219
00:10:33,133 --> 00:10:34,384
Kenapa dengan dia?

220
00:10:34,968 --> 00:10:36,719
Mesin faks tersekat. Geramnya.

221
00:10:39,013 --> 00:10:41,057
- Berapa awak nak untuk diam?
- Separuh.

222
00:10:41,141 --> 00:10:42,642
- 30 peratus.
- 40 peratus.

223
00:10:43,309 --> 00:10:44,144
Setuju.

224
00:10:45,770 --> 00:10:46,980
- Nak saya cuba?
- Tak.

225
00:10:47,772 --> 00:10:49,566
- Hebat!
- Dah dapat.

226
00:10:54,654 --> 00:10:57,115
- Apa yang dicetak?
- "Sila ganti toner." Tak guna.

227
00:10:57,198 --> 00:11:00,034
- Nak cari di mana?
- Tahun 1988. Pernah nampak?

228
00:11:00,118 --> 00:11:01,870
Sebenarnya, tak pernah.

229
00:11:01,953 --> 00:11:03,663
Bagaimana nak hantar ke wad?

230
00:11:03,746 --> 00:11:05,498
Cara lama. Pergi sendiri.

231
00:11:05,832 --> 00:11:08,751
Saya akan minta
bantuan kerani di atas.

232
00:11:13,464 --> 00:11:16,092
Bila kali pertama
awak didiagnosis dengan PCOS?

233
00:11:16,176 --> 00:11:19,012
- Musim panas lalu.
- Simptom bermula waktu itu?

234
00:11:19,095 --> 00:11:21,431
Tak, saya dah lama rasa sakit,

235
00:11:21,514 --> 00:11:23,808
lalui perubahan hormon
dan haid tak normal.

236
00:11:23,892 --> 00:11:27,061
Akhirnya tahu selepas jumpa
doktor yang dengar cakap saya.

237
00:11:27,729 --> 00:11:30,565
Ambil masa untuk dapatkan diagnosis.

238
00:11:31,399 --> 00:11:33,651
Bunyinya macam malas nak rawat.

239
00:11:34,611 --> 00:11:36,779
Doktor tak nak fahami pesakit wanita,

240
00:11:36,863 --> 00:11:38,323
lebih-lebih lagi kulit gelap.

241
00:11:39,282 --> 00:11:40,658
Memang tak mudah.

242
00:11:40,742 --> 00:11:41,951
Bagaimana sekarang?

243
00:11:42,535 --> 00:11:43,620
- Lega.
- Ubat apa?

244
00:11:43,703 --> 00:11:45,038
Suntikan Toradol.

245
00:11:45,705 --> 00:11:48,082
Awak pernah buat
ultrabunyi transvagina?

246
00:11:48,583 --> 00:11:50,293
Dah berkali-kali.

247
00:11:50,376 --> 00:11:52,545
Okey, tolong mengengsot ke bawah,

248
00:11:52,629 --> 00:11:55,506
letakkan kaki di sini.

249
00:11:55,590 --> 00:11:57,759
Ya, awak dah tahu.

250
00:12:06,434 --> 00:12:07,852
Okey, kita mulakan.

251
00:12:08,478 --> 00:12:10,647
Gel ini sejuk
dan awak akan rasa tekanan.

252
00:12:14,067 --> 00:12:14,901
Okey.

253
00:12:16,486 --> 00:12:20,740
Mungkin bukan kehamilan ektopik
sebab ujian air kencing negatif.

254
00:12:21,324 --> 00:12:24,327
- Harapnya positif suatu hari nanti.
- Awak cuba hamil?

255
00:12:24,410 --> 00:12:27,038
Bukan sekarang.
Saya akan kahwin bulan September.

256
00:12:27,997 --> 00:12:29,415
- Tahniah.
- Okey.

257
00:12:31,459 --> 00:12:34,045
Seperti dijangka,
ada beberapa sista kecil.

258
00:12:34,128 --> 00:12:37,382
Tapi ada satu sista besar,
kira-kira 5cm.

259
00:12:38,091 --> 00:12:39,676
Doktor saya memantaunya.

260
00:12:41,135 --> 00:12:45,014
Ada bendalir bebas,
saya periksa aliran darah ke ovari.

261
00:12:45,098 --> 00:12:47,350
Merah ialah arteri, biru ialah vena.

262
00:12:47,934 --> 00:12:49,936
Okey, nampak baik. Saya tarik keluar.

263
00:12:52,146 --> 00:12:53,147
- Maaf.
- Okey.

264
00:12:55,233 --> 00:12:58,278
Kami akan kembali
apabila dapat keputusan darah.

265
00:13:01,364 --> 00:13:02,448
Apa pendapat awak?

266
00:13:02,532 --> 00:13:04,951
Mungkin kebocoran bendalir
daripada sista

267
00:13:05,034 --> 00:13:08,121
menyebabkan rasa sakit yang reda
dengan ubat bukan steroid.

268
00:13:08,204 --> 00:13:09,330
Pelan awak?

269
00:13:09,414 --> 00:13:10,957
Discaj dengan Naproxen?

270
00:13:11,874 --> 00:13:15,670
Awak tak rasa itu
yang doktor sebelum ini buat?

271
00:13:15,753 --> 00:13:18,256
Dia kata dah lega.
Kita perlukan katil.

272
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,049
Dia lemah di triaj.

273
00:13:20,133 --> 00:13:23,052
Rasa sakitnya lebih teruk
berbanding sebelum ini.

274
00:13:23,136 --> 00:13:25,346
- Mari pantau dia seketika.
- Okey.

275
00:13:26,597 --> 00:13:29,309
En. Green, ini Dr. Mohan
dan doktor pelatih, Dr. Ogilvie.

276
00:13:30,685 --> 00:13:32,562
Boleh beritahu
tentang rasa sakit itu?

277
00:13:32,645 --> 00:13:33,938
Rasa macam batu karang lagi.

278
00:13:34,856 --> 00:13:36,691
- Dah pernah jadi?
- Saya kata "lagi",

279
00:13:36,774 --> 00:13:38,651
maksudnya berulang.

280
00:13:40,528 --> 00:13:42,238
Guru bahasa Inggeris di Point Park.

281
00:13:42,947 --> 00:13:45,783
Tak sangka. Ayah saya
guru Inggeris sekolah menengah.

282
00:13:47,869 --> 00:13:50,330
Awak belajar perubatan.
Dia pasti bangga.

283
00:13:51,748 --> 00:13:52,874
Awak kena tanya dia.

284
00:13:53,374 --> 00:13:57,253
Cakap tentang rasa sakit awak,
adakah sama seperti sebelum ini?

285
00:13:57,337 --> 00:14:01,299
Sentiasa sama. Buah pinggang kiri,
bermula 10.00 malam semalam.

286
00:14:01,382 --> 00:14:02,884
Demam? Darah dalam urin?

287
00:14:02,967 --> 00:14:06,846
Tak demam.
Lebih gelap berbanding biasa.

288
00:14:06,929 --> 00:14:08,931
Dehidrasi boleh jadi puncanya.

289
00:14:09,015 --> 00:14:10,516
Condongkan badan ke depan.

290
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:12,310
- Periksa kelembutan CVA.
- Ya.

291
00:14:12,393 --> 00:14:13,227
Baiklah.

292
00:14:15,313 --> 00:14:17,106
Beritahu kalau tak selesa.

293
00:14:20,026 --> 00:14:21,152
- Maaf.
- Ya.

294
00:14:21,235 --> 00:14:23,237
- Kami akan beri ubat dan buat ujian.
- Okey.

295
00:14:28,493 --> 00:14:30,328
Uji urin, Chem 7, ultrabunyi,

296
00:14:30,411 --> 00:14:32,705
periksa hidronefrosis
dan beri Ketorolac.

297
00:14:32,789 --> 00:14:33,956
- Bagus.
- Okey.

298
00:14:40,088 --> 00:14:43,424
- Tanpa membuang masa.
- Kami sangat sibuk, Dr. Barker.

299
00:14:43,508 --> 00:14:44,342
Panggil saya Nick.

300
00:14:47,095 --> 00:14:49,597
- Apa semua ini?
- Saya panggil jururadiologi.

301
00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:53,017
Dr. Barker, Nick,
akan beri keputusan <i>wet-read</i> segera.

302
00:14:53,101 --> 00:14:54,352
- Bernas.
- Terima kasih.

303
00:14:55,311 --> 00:14:57,688
<i>- "Wet-read"?</i>
- Pernah ambil kelas fotografi?

304
00:14:57,772 --> 00:14:59,107
Ya, di sekolah.

305
00:14:59,190 --> 00:15:00,817
Sebelum teknologi digital,

306
00:15:00,900 --> 00:15:03,444
filem X-ray dihasilkan
di bilik gelap dalam rendaman.

307
00:15:03,528 --> 00:15:04,737
Sebab itu namanya begitu.

308
00:15:05,571 --> 00:15:06,614
Hebat.

309
00:15:06,697 --> 00:15:08,199
Dia makan banyak ruang.

310
00:15:09,951 --> 00:15:11,828
Dylan beritahu tentang bayi Jane Doe.

311
00:15:11,911 --> 00:15:14,831
CYF mohon kebenaran
hak jagaan kecemasan.

312
00:15:14,914 --> 00:15:17,375
Sebaik dapat perintah mahkamah,
dia akan dijaga.

313
00:15:17,458 --> 00:15:18,751
Saya minat fotografi.

314
00:15:19,919 --> 00:15:22,338
- Demi Tuhan.
- Dr. Robby, boleh bantu?

315
00:15:22,422 --> 00:15:23,714
Ya. Ada apa?

316
00:15:23,798 --> 00:15:24,841
Dia sakit perut,

317
00:15:24,924 --> 00:15:27,844
- tapi boleh jadi macam-macam.
- Bertenang.

318
00:15:28,344 --> 00:15:30,012
Saya mencari Dr. Mel King.

319
00:15:30,596 --> 00:15:31,431
Ya?

320
00:15:32,849 --> 00:15:35,143
Saya Morgan Stiles, peguam hospital.

321
00:15:35,226 --> 00:15:37,270
Saya akan iring awak untuk deposisi.

322
00:15:37,854 --> 00:15:38,688
Sekarang?

323
00:15:39,647 --> 00:15:42,150
Morgan, boleh saya cakap
dengan dia kejap?

324
00:15:42,942 --> 00:15:43,776
Sudah tentu.

325
00:15:46,279 --> 00:15:49,407
- Pasti tak apa-apa.
- Tak boleh sekarang sebab Becca.

326
00:15:49,490 --> 00:15:51,659
Tak sesuai kalau awak rawat Becca.

327
00:15:51,742 --> 00:15:53,536
Bukan idea baik
sebab awak keluarganya.

328
00:15:53,619 --> 00:15:55,079
Sukar untuk tak dipengaruhi.

329
00:15:55,163 --> 00:15:57,373
Mari tengok siapa ada. Awak lapang?

330
00:15:57,874 --> 00:15:59,459
Siapa yang boleh lapang?

331
00:16:00,710 --> 00:16:01,544
Tak mahu residen.

332
00:16:03,087 --> 00:16:04,464
Orang yang kita cari.

333
00:16:04,547 --> 00:16:05,882
- Nak apa-apa?
- Ya.

334
00:16:07,216 --> 00:16:11,053
Ya, adik Dr. King sakit perut.
Awak ambil kes ini.

335
00:16:11,637 --> 00:16:14,474
Awak pula ambil alih kes dia
sementara deposisinya.

336
00:16:14,557 --> 00:16:16,392
Macam mana nak siapkan kerja

337
00:16:16,476 --> 00:16:18,478
apabila ditambah pesakit
dan sistem lumpuh?

338
00:16:18,561 --> 00:16:19,937
Sama macam orang lain.

339
00:16:20,021 --> 00:16:22,064
Siapkan selepas syif selesai.

340
00:16:23,065 --> 00:16:24,108
Bagus sangatlah.

341
00:16:29,739 --> 00:16:30,990
- Hai, Becca.
- Hai.

342
00:16:31,073 --> 00:16:33,701
Ini Dr. Langdon. Dia akan jaga awak.

343
00:16:33,784 --> 00:16:36,913
Rambut awak sangat cantik,
Dr. Langdon.

344
00:16:37,997 --> 00:16:38,831
Terima kasih.

345
00:16:39,499 --> 00:16:41,959
Mel, boleh matikan lampu
semasa keluar?

346
00:16:42,752 --> 00:16:43,586
Sudah tentu.

347
00:16:44,670 --> 00:16:46,756
Saya akan kembali segera nanti.

348
00:16:47,340 --> 00:16:49,050
Panggil saya kalau apa-apa

349
00:16:49,133 --> 00:16:51,802
- sebab saya boleh datang...
- Jangan risau.

350
00:16:52,678 --> 00:16:53,513
Saya tahu.

351
00:16:54,514 --> 00:16:55,348
Okey.

352
00:17:03,314 --> 00:17:05,775
Mel selalu cakap
cerita baik pasal awak.

353
00:17:08,277 --> 00:17:09,111
Okey.

354
00:17:11,405 --> 00:17:13,366
Ceritakan sebab awak datang.

355
00:17:13,449 --> 00:17:14,534
Saya sakit perut.

356
00:17:15,159 --> 00:17:16,827
Sakit perut? Di mana?

357
00:17:16,911 --> 00:17:18,955
Di sini.

358
00:17:19,038 --> 00:17:23,584
Okey. Ada rasa sakit yang lain
atau di perut saja?

359
00:17:23,668 --> 00:17:25,628
Pedih semasa buang air kecil.

360
00:17:26,337 --> 00:17:30,633
Kadangkala apabila jadi begitu,
wanita rasa nak kencing sentiasa.

361
00:17:30,716 --> 00:17:32,260
- Awak rasa begitu?
- Ya.

362
00:17:32,343 --> 00:17:35,721
- Apa yang berlaku semasa itu?
- Tak keluar apa-apa.

363
00:17:36,931 --> 00:17:38,182
Saya dah agak.

364
00:17:38,266 --> 00:17:40,309
Ya? Bagaimana awak tahu?

365
00:17:41,310 --> 00:17:43,604
Ramai pesakit saya
alami simptom sama.

366
00:17:43,688 --> 00:17:46,023
- Jadi, ia normal?
- Ya, memang normal.

367
00:17:46,941 --> 00:17:48,109
Tapi masih perlu dirawat.

368
00:17:48,901 --> 00:17:49,735
Okey.

369
00:17:56,492 --> 00:17:57,577
Hei.

370
00:17:57,660 --> 00:17:58,744
Awak bagaimana?

371
00:17:59,704 --> 00:18:01,455
- Lebih lega.
- Ya?

372
00:18:01,956 --> 00:18:03,124
Nak morfin lagi?

373
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:12,383
Saya sentiasa kesakitan
selama ini, sayang.

374
00:18:13,259 --> 00:18:14,427
Kenapa tak cakap?

375
00:18:16,262 --> 00:18:17,888
Saya tak nak kamu risau.

376
00:18:20,182 --> 00:18:21,892
Saya tak boleh pura-pura lagi.

377
00:18:23,811 --> 00:18:26,272
Mak, sangat panas di luar
dan aiskrim cair.

378
00:18:28,107 --> 00:18:28,941
Kami...

379
00:18:30,151 --> 00:18:31,652
Kami berbelanja lebih.

380
00:18:33,070 --> 00:18:34,238
Wah. Ya.

381
00:18:35,406 --> 00:18:36,282
Nampak hebat.

382
00:18:36,365 --> 00:18:38,868
Jadi, nak makan yang mana dulu?

383
00:18:38,951 --> 00:18:40,578
Karamel masin, kegemaran mak.

384
00:18:42,288 --> 00:18:43,914
Awak pasti perlukan tisu.

385
00:18:59,889 --> 00:19:00,723
Tak baiknya.

386
00:19:00,806 --> 00:19:02,141
Jangan ternganga.

387
00:19:03,643 --> 00:19:04,685
Bagaimana tadi?

388
00:19:05,353 --> 00:19:06,854
Baik. Langdon pandai layan dia.

389
00:19:06,937 --> 00:19:08,648
Tujuh lagi masih menunggu X-ray,

390
00:19:08,731 --> 00:19:10,524
tapi Dr. Nick guna dari tadi.

391
00:19:12,068 --> 00:19:14,195
Bukankah ada port USB?

392
00:19:14,278 --> 00:19:17,073
Boleh muat turun filem
ke stesen kerja

393
00:19:17,156 --> 00:19:18,616
dan tengok tanpa Internet?

394
00:19:18,699 --> 00:19:20,534
- Ya.
- Terlupa pula.

395
00:19:21,077 --> 00:19:23,496
Dia membantu atau hanya gangguan?

396
00:19:23,579 --> 00:19:26,207
Muat turun segera
dan bantu orang yang perlu X-ray.

397
00:19:26,290 --> 00:19:29,085
Bagus. Saya dah selesai.
Saya akan kembali.

398
00:19:29,168 --> 00:19:31,212
Dr. Robby.
Waris kepada pesakit putus jari

399
00:19:31,295 --> 00:19:32,880
di Pusat 12 dah sampai.

400
00:19:32,963 --> 00:19:35,341
Terima kasih, Olive.
Boleh panggilkan Dr. Santos?

401
00:19:35,424 --> 00:19:37,218
- Baik.
- Siapa di Selatan 22?

402
00:19:37,301 --> 00:19:38,928
Tiada. Pesakit dah discaj.

403
00:19:39,011 --> 00:19:41,347
- Beritahu wanita di situ.
- Siapa?

404
00:19:41,430 --> 00:19:45,184
Saya nak tempatkan pesakit hematuria,
tapi ada orang.

405
00:19:45,267 --> 00:19:46,310
Selatan 22. Pasti?

406
00:19:46,394 --> 00:19:47,895
- Ya.
- Itu pesakit saya.

407
00:19:47,978 --> 00:19:50,064
Kenapa tak tulis pada papan?

408
00:19:51,023 --> 00:19:53,484
Sepatutnya ada.
Olive bawa dari triaj.

409
00:19:53,567 --> 00:19:55,403
Saya terus rawat. Ingatkan dah ada.

410
00:19:55,486 --> 00:19:57,488
Awak patut periksa dan pastikan.

411
00:19:57,571 --> 00:19:59,365
Ingatkan jururawat yang buat.

412
00:19:59,448 --> 00:20:00,741
Semua perlu bantu.

413
00:20:01,283 --> 00:20:03,661
Sekarang tiada katil.
Gunakan koridor.

414
00:20:03,744 --> 00:20:04,704
Siapa nama pesakit?

415
00:20:05,204 --> 00:20:07,373
Pn. Burns, loya.
Saya buat ujian dan X-ray.

416
00:20:07,456 --> 00:20:09,333
- Dengan siapa?
- Saya nak bentangkan kes.

417
00:20:09,417 --> 00:20:12,169
Gerak. Cari doktor dengan "MD"
pada hujung namanya.

418
00:20:14,672 --> 00:20:16,006
Budak-budak ini.

419
00:20:18,592 --> 00:20:22,555
- Saya Dr. Robby. Ini Dr. Santos.
- Chantal.

420
00:20:22,638 --> 00:20:24,348
Apa khabar? Kami rawat adik awak.

421
00:20:24,432 --> 00:20:25,933
Awak penjaga sah Jude?

422
00:20:26,016 --> 00:20:28,811
Ya. Ibu bapa kami tiada.

423
00:20:30,187 --> 00:20:32,398
- Dia akan selamat?
- Dia bernasib baik.

424
00:20:32,481 --> 00:20:35,609
Jari keempat dan kelimanya
pada tangan bukan dominan putus.

425
00:20:35,693 --> 00:20:38,279
Kalau dia tak buang
mercun itu, lagi teruk.

426
00:20:38,362 --> 00:20:40,114
Putus jari sebab mercun?

427
00:20:41,365 --> 00:20:43,117
Dia akan dapat guna tangannya?

428
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:45,786
Ya, tiga jari paling penting
masih selamat

429
00:20:45,870 --> 00:20:47,204
dan berfungsi.

430
00:20:47,288 --> 00:20:50,082
Dia perlu dibedah
untuk tutup luka dan akan sembuh.

431
00:20:50,916 --> 00:20:53,878
- Awak tiada otak?
- Maafkan saya.

432
00:20:53,961 --> 00:20:56,881
Alex ajak ke rumah.
Dia dan abangnya ada banyak...

433
00:20:56,964 --> 00:21:00,009
Bukankah saya pesan
jangan kawan dengan mereka?

434
00:21:00,092 --> 00:21:01,260
Tengok apa jadi?

435
00:21:01,343 --> 00:21:03,220
Awak fikir saya nak putus jari?

436
00:21:03,304 --> 00:21:05,765
- Dengar cakap saya.
- Awak bukan mak saya!

437
00:21:05,848 --> 00:21:09,477
- Awak rasa saya nak jadi mak awak?
- Mari kita keluar kejap.

438
00:21:14,148 --> 00:21:16,734
Saya tahu keadaan ini bukan mudah.

439
00:21:16,817 --> 00:21:19,904
- Hampir putus tangan sebab bodoh.
- Dia baik.

440
00:21:19,987 --> 00:21:20,821
Dululah.

441
00:21:20,905 --> 00:21:22,698
Kami jumpa sesuatu juga.

442
00:21:23,741 --> 00:21:26,410
- Apa?
- Alkohol darahnya, 0.8.

443
00:21:28,496 --> 00:21:29,580
Kejap. Dia mabuk?

444
00:21:29,663 --> 00:21:31,415
Biar betul?

445
00:21:31,499 --> 00:21:33,459
- Dia kerap minum?
- Tak.

446
00:21:35,544 --> 00:21:36,378
Saya tak tahulah.

447
00:21:37,087 --> 00:21:40,257
Budak lelaki di kompleks kami
beri pengaruh buruk.

448
00:21:41,091 --> 00:21:43,719
- Dia cuma 12 tahun.
- Itu yang membimbangkan.

449
00:21:43,803 --> 00:21:47,181
Keputusan positif cetuskan
rujukan khidmat sosial.

450
00:21:47,848 --> 00:21:50,559
- Dia akan dibawa pergi?
- Penilaian akan tentukan

451
00:21:50,643 --> 00:21:53,229
jika kecederaan dan kemabukan
memerlukan intervensi.

452
00:21:53,312 --> 00:21:55,481
- Jangan pisahkan kami! Tidak!
- Kami perlu...

453
00:22:05,783 --> 00:22:07,827
Wanita, 58 tahun,
loya, muntah satu kali,

454
00:22:07,910 --> 00:22:09,954
selepas makan
salad kentang di barbeku.

455
00:22:10,037 --> 00:22:11,539
Hidrasi baik, abdomen okey,

456
00:22:11,622 --> 00:22:13,707
kembung dengan kelembutan ringan.

457
00:22:13,791 --> 00:22:15,835
Sejarah sembelit. Saya beri Zofran.

458
00:22:15,918 --> 00:22:18,921
- Masih tunggu keputusan makmal.
- Mari tengok.

459
00:22:19,004 --> 00:22:22,675
Baik. Pn. Burns. Ini Dr. Whitaker.
Bagaimana keadaan awak?

460
00:22:24,176 --> 00:22:25,010
Pn. Burns?

461
00:22:26,178 --> 00:22:28,305
Pn. Burns. Boleh buka mata?

462
00:22:28,389 --> 00:22:30,057
Dia masih sedar tadi.

463
00:22:30,140 --> 00:22:33,143
Okey, rasa hangat. Nadi lemah.

464
00:22:33,227 --> 00:22:36,981
- Abdomen lebih kembung.
- Okey, pernafasan agonal.

465
00:22:37,064 --> 00:22:38,816
- Hampir tak bernafas.
- Abdomen keras.

466
00:22:38,899 --> 00:22:42,027
Ya. Perlah, troli kecemasan.
Boleh panggil Respiratori?

467
00:22:42,111 --> 00:22:43,988
- Tarik katil untuk intubasi.
- Ya.

468
00:22:44,655 --> 00:22:46,031
Saya boleh beri ruang.

469
00:22:47,950 --> 00:22:50,327
- Apa jadi?
- Hipotensi. Abdomen akut.

470
00:22:50,411 --> 00:22:52,288
- Perlu saluran.
- Saya cari GlideScope.

471
00:22:52,371 --> 00:22:55,040
Tiada masa.
Guna troli kecemasan. Whitaker, awak.

472
00:22:55,124 --> 00:22:58,002
- Saya jarang buat.
- Buat lagi. Guna jaring induksi.

473
00:22:58,586 --> 00:22:59,879
Seratus ketamin, 80 roc.

474
00:22:59,962 --> 00:23:01,589
Javadi, apa ceritanya?

475
00:23:02,798 --> 00:23:05,426
Masuk dengan sakit abdomen ringan,
tapi makin teruk.

476
00:23:07,595 --> 00:23:10,055
AFib 122, tekanan darah sistolik 98.

477
00:23:10,139 --> 00:23:12,683
- Tambah lagi 500cc.
- Kita kejutkan dia?

478
00:23:12,766 --> 00:23:15,644
Mungkin lepas intubasi.
Periksa lampu dan belon.

479
00:23:15,728 --> 00:23:17,980
Javadi, pasang pad AP
kalau perlu kardioversi.

480
00:23:18,063 --> 00:23:20,149
EKG normal semasa triaj. Bukan AFib.

481
00:23:20,232 --> 00:23:21,984
Tekanan penyakit mungkin cetuskan.

482
00:23:22,568 --> 00:23:23,903
Bagus. Miringkan dia.

483
00:23:23,986 --> 00:23:25,738
- Ada keputusan makmal?
- Belum.

484
00:23:25,821 --> 00:23:26,906
Apa lagi kita perlu?

485
00:23:28,032 --> 00:23:30,910
Kultur darah.
Laktat, dua liter LR, 3.375 pip-tazo.

486
00:23:31,827 --> 00:23:33,787
Dah kendur. Teruskan, Whitaker.

487
00:23:34,538 --> 00:23:35,372
Okey.

488
00:23:42,755 --> 00:23:45,549
Hai, Dr. Santos.
Ini doktor pelatih, Dr. Kwon.

489
00:23:45,633 --> 00:23:47,134
Macam mana keadaan awak?

490
00:23:47,217 --> 00:23:48,761
Lebih baik berbanding tadi.

491
00:23:49,178 --> 00:23:51,347
Kami akan periksa tanda vital awak.

492
00:23:53,849 --> 00:23:57,978
Suhu 37.8, kadar denyutan jantung 96.

493
00:23:58,062 --> 00:24:00,981
Okey, turun daripada 38.6
dan 120. Sangat bagus.

494
00:24:02,358 --> 00:24:03,943
Awak pakai kostum itu dalam panas?

495
00:24:04,652 --> 00:24:08,572
- Ya, dengan kira-kira 18,000 kawan.
- Awak pergi Anthrocon?

496
00:24:09,698 --> 00:24:10,741
Apa itu?

497
00:24:10,824 --> 00:24:13,702
Konvensyen <i>furry</i> tahunan Pittsburgh.
Saya pergi setiap tahun.

498
00:24:14,787 --> 00:24:15,663
Pernah pergi?

499
00:24:16,830 --> 00:24:18,290
Saya tak minat sangat.

500
00:24:19,249 --> 00:24:23,712
Ya, <i>furry</i> dapat reputasi buruk,
tapi komunitinya bagus.

501
00:24:23,796 --> 00:24:26,632
Kreatif, mesra dan lucu.

502
00:24:27,549 --> 00:24:29,635
Saya kenal kekasih
di acara tahun lalu.

503
00:24:30,552 --> 00:24:31,637
Comelnya.

504
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:33,931
Dia beri saya harapan
tanpa aplikasi dating.

505
00:24:34,765 --> 00:24:36,976
Bagus dapat kenal secara berdepan.

506
00:24:37,059 --> 00:24:39,353
Saya tak sarankan
jika di tempat kerja.

507
00:24:40,896 --> 00:24:42,856
Datanglah ke Anthrocon
hujung minggu ini.

508
00:24:44,149 --> 00:24:47,945
- Tak perlukan kostum untuknya?
- Awak sesuai jadi naga.

509
00:24:52,074 --> 00:24:54,368
Dah masuk. Belon kembung.

510
00:24:56,161 --> 00:24:56,996
Ya, pam begnya.

511
00:24:58,539 --> 00:25:00,416
Okey. Susah tanpa video.

512
00:25:00,499 --> 00:25:01,959
Video tak selalu ada.

513
00:25:02,042 --> 00:25:04,545
AFib sekarang 152.
Tekanan darah jatuh, 76/44.

514
00:25:04,628 --> 00:25:06,171
Okey, Javadi. Mod segerak.

515
00:25:06,255 --> 00:25:08,382
Javadi, mod segerak. Cas kepada 200.

516
00:25:09,633 --> 00:25:11,385
Tidal hujung bagus.

517
00:25:11,468 --> 00:25:13,554
Bagus. Bunyi nafas
di kedua-dua belah.

518
00:25:15,139 --> 00:25:17,224
Caj ke kardioversi. Semua ke tepi.

519
00:25:21,729 --> 00:25:23,397
- Sinus normal.
- Nadi normal.

520
00:25:25,733 --> 00:25:28,152
Bagus. Bekalkan cecair.
Kita tunggu keputusan makmal.

521
00:25:31,155 --> 00:25:31,989
Bagus.

522
00:25:32,614 --> 00:25:33,615
Sangat bagus.

523
00:25:35,075 --> 00:25:38,328
- Buat ujian apa?
- CBC, panel kimia AR.

524
00:25:38,412 --> 00:25:40,706
- Sepatutnya dah dapat.
- Faks habis dakwat.

525
00:25:40,789 --> 00:25:43,375
- Semak carta.
- Tiada di slot 22.

526
00:25:43,459 --> 00:25:44,585
Semak rak pesanan.

527
00:25:45,878 --> 00:25:49,256
- Tiada juga.
- Di mana carta Claire Burns?

528
00:25:49,339 --> 00:25:50,174
SLIP MAKMAL

529
00:25:51,925 --> 00:25:54,970
"Claire Burns, slip pesanan.
Tiada sampel, tak dihantar."

530
00:25:55,054 --> 00:25:57,639
Sebab nama tiada di papan.
Jururawat buat ikut zon.

531
00:25:57,723 --> 00:25:59,850
Jika nama tiada di papan,
kiranya tak wujud.

532
00:25:59,933 --> 00:26:01,143
Jadi, tiada X-ray?

533
00:26:01,226 --> 00:26:03,395
Kotak slip X-ray kosong,
maksudnya dah dibuat.

534
00:26:03,479 --> 00:26:06,899
- Maksudnya di mesin mudah alih.
- Tadi ada di Utara.

535
00:26:08,192 --> 00:26:09,318
- Terima kasih.
- Ya.

536
00:26:10,069 --> 00:26:11,695
Kenny. Boleh tunggu kejap?

537
00:26:11,779 --> 00:26:14,031
Kalau nak X-ray,
tulis pesanan dan isi slip.

538
00:26:14,114 --> 00:26:15,407
Ada untuk Selatan 22?

539
00:26:15,491 --> 00:26:16,742
Mungkin jururadiologi lain?

540
00:26:16,825 --> 00:26:19,953
Boleh cari X-ray
untuk pesakit bernama Burns?

541
00:26:24,875 --> 00:26:27,503
- Tak guna.
- Jelas. Volvulus sigmoid.

542
00:26:27,586 --> 00:26:29,963
- Peritoneal.
- Pesakit perlu dibedah cepat.

543
00:26:37,846 --> 00:26:39,431
TANDAS

544
00:26:39,515 --> 00:26:42,434
- Ada darah dalam urin.
- Seperti dijangka.

545
00:26:43,769 --> 00:26:47,356
BUN dan kreatinin normal.
Tiada petanda buah pinggang rosak.

546
00:26:47,439 --> 00:26:50,359
Saya dapat lihat buah pinggang kiri.
Hidronefrosis ringan.

547
00:26:50,442 --> 00:26:52,361
Selaras dengan kolik ureter.

548
00:26:52,444 --> 00:26:55,197
- Bagaimana dengan ultrabunyi?
- Normal.

549
00:26:55,280 --> 00:26:57,783
Sakit reda selepas 15mg Ketorolac IM.

550
00:26:58,534 --> 00:27:00,536
Boleh beri lagi 15mg dan pantau.

551
00:27:03,455 --> 00:27:05,165
Cuma perlukan sain awak untuk sahkan.

552
00:27:07,918 --> 00:27:08,752
Terima kasih.

553
00:27:09,753 --> 00:27:10,921
Fikiran terganggu?

554
00:27:11,839 --> 00:27:14,424
Ya, ada pesakit saya sejam tadi.

555
00:27:14,508 --> 00:27:16,260
Lingkungan 60-an, pura-pura sakit

556
00:27:16,343 --> 00:27:18,554
untuk datang berbual sekali-sekala

557
00:27:18,637 --> 00:27:20,013
sebab dia kesunyian.

558
00:27:20,806 --> 00:27:22,349
Pasti dia tak menaruh hati?

559
00:27:22,432 --> 00:27:24,643
Mungkin, tapi saya teringat mak saya.

560
00:27:25,310 --> 00:27:26,937
Mungkin mak saya cuma kesunyian.

561
00:27:27,938 --> 00:27:28,772
Ya.

562
00:27:30,065 --> 00:27:33,610
Sejujurnya, saya tak keluar
janji temu sejak bercerai.

563
00:27:34,319 --> 00:27:36,613
Kolej perubatan,
anak, latihan kepakaran.

564
00:27:37,239 --> 00:27:39,283
Sekarang saya rasa dah sedia.

565
00:27:39,366 --> 00:27:42,411
Saya tunggu nak kembali ke Jersey
untuk cuba bina hubungan,

566
00:27:42,494 --> 00:27:43,662
tapi dah tak boleh.

567
00:27:44,496 --> 00:27:45,831
Mungkin dah terlambat.

568
00:27:46,498 --> 00:27:47,332
Untuk apa?

569
00:27:47,958 --> 00:27:48,834
Dengar tak?

570
00:27:50,085 --> 00:27:53,338
Sunyi yang menyakitkan itu
macam bunyi ovum saya sedang mati.

571
00:27:58,135 --> 00:28:00,137
Pesakit ruam di Utara 3 dah discaj.

572
00:28:00,220 --> 00:28:02,931
Pelajar direnjat di Pusat 10
dihantar ke Psikiatri.

573
00:28:03,015 --> 00:28:05,017
Pesakit strok mata kini di ICU,

574
00:28:05,100 --> 00:28:08,395
koyakan lidah di Selatan 15
sedang redakan mabuk.

575
00:28:08,478 --> 00:28:10,147
Harap cepat, kita perlukan bilik.

576
00:28:10,230 --> 00:28:12,691
Saya ambil pelajar perubatan
dan uruskan pesakit.

577
00:28:12,774 --> 00:28:14,735
Awak tak terkesan
dengan kekecohan ini?

578
00:28:15,444 --> 00:28:18,405
Kecoh betul.
Ya Tuhan, kami perlukan bantuan-Mu.

579
00:28:20,574 --> 00:28:23,452
Monica Peters, ini pakar kami,
Dr. Al-Hashimi.

580
00:28:23,535 --> 00:28:25,204
- Selamat datang.
- Terima kasih.

581
00:28:25,787 --> 00:28:27,539
Monica bekas kerani,
dia yang terbaik.

582
00:28:27,623 --> 00:28:30,584
Sanggup datang ketika cuti
untuk bantu kita lebih teratur.

583
00:28:30,667 --> 00:28:33,587
Diberhentikan dek revolusi digital,
bukan bersara.

584
00:28:33,670 --> 00:28:36,548
Jadi, tengoklah
sistem digital itu sekarang?

585
00:28:36,632 --> 00:28:38,550
- Teruk.
- Betul.

586
00:28:39,343 --> 00:28:42,304
Baiklah. Siapa urus
rekod dan pesanan?

587
00:28:42,387 --> 00:28:43,472
Kami.

588
00:28:43,555 --> 00:28:45,349
Berapa lama dah jadi kerani?

589
00:28:45,432 --> 00:28:47,434
Hari ini. Kami pembantu perubatan.

590
00:28:48,018 --> 00:28:50,729
Kalau begitu, bangun
dan buat kerja yang awak tahu.

591
00:28:51,313 --> 00:28:54,441
Tak boleh panggilan peribadi.
Telefon merah hanya untuk kecemasan.

592
00:28:54,524 --> 00:28:56,944
- Tolonglah, ini hospital.
- Saya hubungi balik.

593
00:28:57,778 --> 00:28:59,154
- Ada getah?
- Ya.

594
00:28:59,238 --> 00:29:02,449
Saya Makedah dari pentadbiran.
Lencana baharu untuk Dr. Whitaker.

595
00:29:02,532 --> 00:29:03,492
Ya.

596
00:29:03,575 --> 00:29:05,994
- Saya akan berikan.
- Kamu perlu penghantar?

597
00:29:06,078 --> 00:29:08,497
- Tepat pada masanya.
- Berapa laju awak boleh gerak?

598
00:29:08,580 --> 00:29:10,165
- Saya pelari maraton.
- Bagus.

599
00:29:10,249 --> 00:29:13,085
Ambil sampel di bekas
dan hantar ke makmal.

600
00:29:13,168 --> 00:29:15,921
- Saya perlukan setiap 15 minit.
- Okey.

601
00:29:22,177 --> 00:29:23,887
Saya kerja di kedai kasut di Oakland.

602
00:29:24,471 --> 00:29:27,599
- Sepenuh masa sambil belajar?
- Ya.

603
00:29:28,225 --> 00:29:29,476
Kolej Komuniti Allegheny.

604
00:29:29,559 --> 00:29:34,106
Adakah Jude pergi kelas tambahan
atau kem semasa awak tiada?

605
00:29:36,275 --> 00:29:37,109
Tak mampu.

606
00:29:37,859 --> 00:29:41,029
Ada ahli keluarga lain
yang boleh bantu jaga dia?

607
00:29:42,030 --> 00:29:42,864
Tiada.

608
00:29:46,702 --> 00:29:49,371
Chantal, kami nak tolong.
Awak perlu beritahu kami.

609
00:29:50,831 --> 00:29:53,292
Kalau tak, awak akan hantar dia
ke rumah jagaan?

610
00:29:54,543 --> 00:29:56,295
Saya dah janji dengan ibu bapa kami.

611
00:29:57,462 --> 00:29:59,423
Adakah mereka dah meninggal dunia?

612
00:29:59,506 --> 00:30:00,340
Tak.

613
00:30:01,091 --> 00:30:02,217
Apa yang terjadi?

614
00:30:09,558 --> 00:30:12,019
Mereka dihantar pulang ke Haiti
sembilan bulan lepas.

615
00:30:15,355 --> 00:30:18,608
Mereka pergi perbicaraan imigresen,
kemudian ditahan.

616
00:30:20,902 --> 00:30:22,070
Saya tahun dua di Ithaca.

617
00:30:22,154 --> 00:30:24,239
Saya terpaksa balik untuk jaga adik.

618
00:30:26,116 --> 00:30:26,950
Saya simpati.

619
00:30:28,076 --> 00:30:30,912
Saya kena balik
atau dia ikut mereka ke Haiti.

620
00:30:32,706 --> 00:30:33,874
Dia tak pernah ke sana.

621
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:36,168
Kami lahir di sini.

622
00:30:40,130 --> 00:30:42,591
Mak saya seronok
apabila saya masuk kolej.

623
00:30:43,425 --> 00:30:47,721
Dia gigih bekerja dan simpan duit
untuk bayar yuran saya.

624
00:30:48,638 --> 00:30:51,975
Sekarang, dia cuma mahu
adik saya habiskan persekolahan.

625
00:30:54,895 --> 00:30:58,273
Lebih mudah menjadi kakaknya
berbanding pengganti mak.

626
00:31:01,526 --> 00:31:04,696
Tolong berikan kami masa.
Saya akan panggil nanti.

627
00:31:09,826 --> 00:31:11,745
Kita perlu libatkan khidmat sosial?

628
00:31:12,329 --> 00:31:15,332
Awak panggil mereka untuk pesakit ITP
berumur 8 tahun pagi tadi.

629
00:31:16,124 --> 00:31:18,418
Itu lain. Penderaan bukan pengabaian.

630
00:31:19,002 --> 00:31:21,338
Kita tak patut pisahkan mereka.

631
00:31:21,421 --> 00:31:23,757
Banyak yang tak patut
terjadi di sini.

632
00:31:29,763 --> 00:31:31,890
K, pesakit mengadu sakit.

633
00:31:32,724 --> 00:31:33,558
Ya.

634
00:31:35,811 --> 00:31:38,271
Maya, ada apa?

635
00:31:38,355 --> 00:31:40,148
Sangat sakit lagi.

636
00:31:40,232 --> 00:31:42,234
Jesse, boleh panggil Whitaker?

637
00:31:42,317 --> 00:31:44,361
- Bila mula sakit?
- Dua minit lalu.

638
00:31:44,444 --> 00:31:47,030
Kami berikan morfin untuk legakan.

639
00:31:47,114 --> 00:31:50,075
- Berapa skala sakit awak?
- 12, lebih teruk.

640
00:31:50,158 --> 00:31:54,246
Okey. Maya, ubat akan berkesan
dan kami akan periksa faraj

641
00:31:54,329 --> 00:31:56,039
untuk pastikan, okey?

642
00:32:02,295 --> 00:32:04,339
Saya perlu minta kebenaran suaminya.

643
00:32:05,257 --> 00:32:07,426
- Okey.
- Dr. Shamsi akan bedah.

644
00:32:08,552 --> 00:32:10,971
Kenapa tak panggil saya
bila ada petanda peritoneal?

645
00:32:12,097 --> 00:32:14,099
Lambat disedari.

646
00:32:14,891 --> 00:32:17,477
Buat X-ray sejam lepas.
Kenapa tak periksa?

647
00:32:17,561 --> 00:32:19,312
Keliru kerana sistem digital lumpuh.

648
00:32:19,396 --> 00:32:21,523
Kami tak tahu atau dapat laporan.

649
00:32:21,606 --> 00:32:25,444
Sejam lepas boleh dipulihkan
dengan segera guna tiub rektal.

650
00:32:26,111 --> 00:32:27,529
Sekarang perlu dibedah.

651
00:32:28,113 --> 00:32:28,947
Maafkan saya.

652
00:32:29,030 --> 00:32:31,491
Itu tak cukup, anak kroni.
Awak buat salah.

653
00:32:31,575 --> 00:32:33,910
Jangan percaya apa
atau sesiapa bila sistem rosak.

654
00:32:35,871 --> 00:32:38,832
Beginilah. Keadaannya tak disedari
dalam kekecohan ini.

655
00:32:41,084 --> 00:32:42,294
Pesakit hampir mati.

656
00:32:44,421 --> 00:32:45,630
Saya penyebabnya.

657
00:32:46,465 --> 00:32:48,717
- Whitaker. McKay panggil awak.
- Tak.

658
00:32:50,177 --> 00:32:53,013
Kita sempat sedar.
Takkan berulang lagi, okey?

659
00:33:07,068 --> 00:33:08,570
Princess cari awak.

660
00:33:09,529 --> 00:33:11,406
Dia sebut nama Monica,

661
00:33:11,490 --> 00:33:12,574
tapi saya tak faham.

662
00:33:12,657 --> 00:33:14,075
Okey, sekejap.

663
00:33:14,910 --> 00:33:16,119
Hei!

664
00:33:18,121 --> 00:33:19,831
Awak pandai kendalikan mangsa tadi.

665
00:33:21,374 --> 00:33:23,418
Awak sangat hebat.

666
00:33:23,502 --> 00:33:25,295
Kita cuba berikan penjagaan terbaik

667
00:33:25,378 --> 00:33:27,797
kepada orang yang mengalami trauma.

668
00:33:29,466 --> 00:33:31,801
Apa yang awak cakap kepadanya tadi?

669
00:33:32,802 --> 00:33:33,637
Saya...

670
00:33:35,055 --> 00:33:38,725
Saya kata mungkin suatu hari nanti

671
00:33:38,808 --> 00:33:39,976
dia nak buat dakwaan.

672
00:33:41,770 --> 00:33:43,438
Lebih baik ada pilihan itu.

673
00:33:44,272 --> 00:33:45,106
Bijak.

674
00:33:48,902 --> 00:33:50,237
Adakah setiap hari begini?

675
00:33:50,320 --> 00:33:51,947
Kecuali serangan siber.

676
00:33:52,614 --> 00:33:53,448
Ya.

677
00:33:54,658 --> 00:33:57,786
Tapi senarai tugas awak
yang pertama hampir selesai.

678
00:33:59,162 --> 00:34:00,038
Berbanggalah.

679
00:34:07,546 --> 00:34:09,756
Ambil diet makanan lembut.

680
00:34:09,839 --> 00:34:14,261
Macam kentang lecek, sup,
makaroni dan keju memang sesuai.

681
00:34:15,303 --> 00:34:17,472
Saya nak masak tiga kacang malam ini.

682
00:34:17,556 --> 00:34:20,475
- Baiknya.
- Saya memang baik.

683
00:34:21,643 --> 00:34:22,644
Dia boleh makan?

684
00:34:23,520 --> 00:34:24,980
Ya.

685
00:34:25,063 --> 00:34:26,398
Jika makan guna sudu

686
00:34:26,481 --> 00:34:29,526
dan bukan makanan rangup
yang boleh masuk celah luka.

687
00:34:30,735 --> 00:34:32,696
Jadi, dia perlu disuap.

688
00:34:34,447 --> 00:34:36,032
Antibiotik, tiga kali sehari.

689
00:34:36,116 --> 00:34:38,201
Datang lagi dua hari untuk diperiksa.

690
00:34:38,285 --> 00:34:39,828
Jumpa lagi, doktor.

691
00:34:42,289 --> 00:34:44,583
Saya periksa aliran darah ke ovari.

692
00:34:49,629 --> 00:34:50,505
Ada masalah?

693
00:34:50,589 --> 00:34:51,881
Torsi berselang.

694
00:34:52,507 --> 00:34:53,341
Apa itu?

695
00:34:54,092 --> 00:34:55,385
Saya keluar sekarang.

696
00:34:56,595 --> 00:34:57,887
Awak boleh baring semula.

697
00:34:59,598 --> 00:35:03,893
Ovari awak terpintal
dan bekalan darah terputus.

698
00:35:03,977 --> 00:35:05,812
Itulah punca kesakitan ini.

699
00:35:06,313 --> 00:35:09,608
Tadi bekalan darah baik.

700
00:35:09,691 --> 00:35:11,693
Kadangkala ovari berpintal
secara rawak.

701
00:35:13,320 --> 00:35:16,114
Dalam kes begitu,
sakitnya datang dan pergi.

702
00:35:17,282 --> 00:35:18,241
Boleh awak rawat?

703
00:35:18,825 --> 00:35:20,577
- Melalui pembedahan.
- Pembedahan?

704
00:35:20,660 --> 00:35:24,122
Pintalan perlu dileraikan
dan disemat dengan jahitan

705
00:35:24,205 --> 00:35:25,957
agar ia tak berulang.

706
00:35:26,041 --> 00:35:28,543
Jika dibedah segera,
ia dapat diselamatkan.

707
00:35:29,502 --> 00:35:30,712
Ovari saya mungkin rosak?

708
00:35:32,672 --> 00:35:36,051
- Saya masih mampu hamil?
- Sepatutnya tiada masalah.

709
00:35:36,134 --> 00:35:39,804
Dr. McKay buat keputusan betul
dengan memantau awak di ER

710
00:35:39,888 --> 00:35:41,848
supaya kami sedar
apabila sakit semula.

711
00:35:43,558 --> 00:35:44,476
Terima kasih.

712
00:35:45,727 --> 00:35:46,936
- Saya hubungi GYN.
- Ya.

713
00:35:47,020 --> 00:35:49,856
RAK DISCAJ

714
00:35:49,939 --> 00:35:51,691
Selamat kembali. Macam mana tadi?

715
00:35:51,775 --> 00:35:53,943
Lancar. Presby agak cantik.

716
00:35:54,027 --> 00:35:55,987
Saya mungkin perlu buat
syif siang di sana.

717
00:35:57,197 --> 00:35:58,615
<i>Dr. Abbot kelakar.</i>

718
00:35:58,698 --> 00:36:00,909
- Itu tak berkekalan.
- Taklah.

719
00:36:00,992 --> 00:36:02,160
Dia tak diberi bius?

720
00:36:02,243 --> 00:36:04,496
Saya beri Versed
untuk CT dan ketika pulang,

721
00:36:04,579 --> 00:36:07,165
tapi dia perlu sedar
untuk berikan kebenaran.

722
00:36:07,248 --> 00:36:09,292
- Kebenaran?
- Kami akan pindahkan awak.

723
00:36:09,376 --> 00:36:11,961
- Tolong panggil Garcia?
- Dr. Robby?

724
00:36:12,045 --> 00:36:13,713
- Boleh uruskan?
- Semestinya.

725
00:36:13,797 --> 00:36:14,631
Ya.

726
00:36:15,256 --> 00:36:16,257
Baiklah, Howard.

727
00:36:17,384 --> 00:36:20,428
Saya nak dengar <i>debrief</i> tentang
pesakit volvulus sigmoid nanti.

728
00:36:21,221 --> 00:36:23,139
- Saya selesai dengan kakaknya.
- Jadi?

729
00:36:23,223 --> 00:36:25,392
Dia bertanggungjawab
dan penjaga yang baik.

730
00:36:25,475 --> 00:36:27,852
Tak perlu libatkan khidmat sosial.

731
00:36:27,936 --> 00:36:30,814
- Bagus.
- Disebabkan adiknya akan dibedah,

732
00:36:30,897 --> 00:36:32,649
mungkin mereka akan melawat rumah

733
00:36:32,732 --> 00:36:34,317
untuk menilai keselamatan

734
00:36:34,401 --> 00:36:37,153
dan penjagaan yang Chantal berikan
serta kewajipan lain.

735
00:36:37,237 --> 00:36:38,738
Kemudian? Mereka ambil Jude?

736
00:36:38,822 --> 00:36:40,949
Mengikut pengalaman,
penilaiannya sama.

737
00:36:41,032 --> 00:36:42,492
Tak suka pisahkan adik-beradik.

738
00:36:43,827 --> 00:36:44,953
Boleh kami boleh bantu?

739
00:36:45,036 --> 00:36:47,497
Saya akan cari sumber untuk Chantal,

740
00:36:47,580 --> 00:36:48,707
program selepas sekolah,

741
00:36:48,790 --> 00:36:51,710
tapi ada waktunya lebih baik
dia bersama ibu bapa di Haiti.

742
00:36:51,793 --> 00:36:53,128
Ibu bapanya mahu dia di sini.

743
00:36:53,211 --> 00:36:54,963
- Itu yang terbaik.
- Siapa cakap?

744
00:36:55,046 --> 00:36:56,631
Dr. Santos, cukup.

745
00:37:00,176 --> 00:37:02,137
Selamat kembali, En. Knox.
Apa keputusannya?

746
00:37:02,220 --> 00:37:04,848
Abses yang berkembang
menyebabkan kebocoran

747
00:37:04,931 --> 00:37:06,683
dengan udara bebas
di bawah diafragma.

748
00:37:06,766 --> 00:37:08,059
<i>Boleh mudahkan?</i>

749
00:37:08,143 --> 00:37:11,896
Ada lubang kecil pada usus besar
membocorkan bakteria ke abdomen.

750
00:37:11,980 --> 00:37:15,024
Awak berisiko mengalami
peritonitis dan sepsis.

751
00:37:16,735 --> 00:37:18,611
<i>- Seteruk mana?</i>
- Perlu dibedah sekarang.

752
00:37:18,695 --> 00:37:21,030
Tanpanya, 100% mungkin mati.

753
00:37:22,949 --> 00:37:23,783
<i>Jika dibedah?</i>

754
00:37:26,703 --> 00:37:27,829
Kemungkinan 50%.

755
00:37:31,624 --> 00:37:32,667
<i>Saya mungkin mati.</i>

756
00:37:32,751 --> 00:37:34,502
Ya, tapi kami mahir.

757
00:37:34,586 --> 00:37:36,755
Sebab itu perlu borang keizinan.

758
00:37:38,131 --> 00:37:39,507
<i>Bagaimana kakak saya?</i>

759
00:37:39,591 --> 00:37:40,842
Ya, kami dapat hubungi.

760
00:37:40,925 --> 00:37:42,635
Dia nak bercakap dengan awak.

761
00:37:42,719 --> 00:37:46,055
Kita tiada masa.
Jika ditangguh, bahaya meningkat.

762
00:37:46,598 --> 00:37:48,600
<i>Saya nak cakap dengan kakak dulu.</i>

763
00:37:53,062 --> 00:37:54,689
Kami akan bantu.

764
00:37:55,940 --> 00:37:57,776
Saya sediakan bilik bedah,
tapi cepat.

765
00:37:57,859 --> 00:37:58,902
- Cepat.
- Ya.

766
00:37:58,985 --> 00:38:00,612
Kita pindah lagi, Howard.

767
00:38:16,711 --> 00:38:17,545
Hei.

768
00:38:20,799 --> 00:38:22,217
Parti aiskrim dah habis?

769
00:38:24,552 --> 00:38:25,386
Ya.

770
00:38:26,846 --> 00:38:28,014
Awak perlu apa-apa?

771
00:38:31,684 --> 00:38:32,685
Mesin masa.

772
00:38:37,690 --> 00:38:39,025
Pasti bagus, bukan?

773
00:38:44,572 --> 00:38:46,699
Saya tak tahu mana lebih sakit.

774
00:38:47,951 --> 00:38:49,285
Kanser atau...

775
00:38:52,831 --> 00:38:55,250
sedar yang saya tak dapat
tengok anak saya dewasa.

776
00:38:58,461 --> 00:38:59,838
Sangat tak adil.

777
00:39:02,423 --> 00:39:04,425
Kenapa berikan saya

778
00:39:05,301 --> 00:39:06,970
anak dan suami yang baik

779
00:39:07,053 --> 00:39:08,721
jika akhirnya dirampas?

780
00:39:11,307 --> 00:39:13,852
Untuk apa? Kanser peparu tak guna.

781
00:39:17,605 --> 00:39:18,690
Saya tak merokok pun.

782
00:39:27,532 --> 00:39:28,658
Awak percaya Tuhan?

783
00:39:31,870 --> 00:39:33,204
Saya suka konsepnya.

784
00:39:38,126 --> 00:39:39,544
Awak dah biasa tengok kematian.

785
00:39:41,421 --> 00:39:42,547
Adalah juga.

786
00:39:46,384 --> 00:39:47,343
Ada nasihat?

787
00:39:53,641 --> 00:39:55,393
Saya tak pernah mati.

788
00:40:05,737 --> 00:40:08,323
Maaf, kami di luar. Ada...

789
00:40:08,781 --> 00:40:12,243
Tiada isyarat di dalam,
tapi dia dah sampai.

790
00:40:14,787 --> 00:40:15,622
<i>Oh, Tuhan.</i>

791
00:40:16,623 --> 00:40:17,540
<i>Awak okey?</i>

792
00:40:20,043 --> 00:40:22,170
<i>Dulu lebih baik. Awak nampak cantik.</i>

793
00:40:24,005 --> 00:40:24,839
<i>Terima kasih.</i>

794
00:40:26,007 --> 00:40:27,091
<i>Awak nampak tak sihat.</i>

795
00:40:30,261 --> 00:40:31,638
<i>Terima kasih sebab hubungi.</i>

796
00:40:35,016 --> 00:40:35,850
<i>Sudah tentu.</i>

797
00:40:36,935 --> 00:40:39,145
<i>Maaf sebab ambil masa lama.</i>

798
00:40:39,812 --> 00:40:41,689
<i>Masalah dengan ayah dan mabuknya...</i>

799
00:40:43,524 --> 00:40:45,193
<i>Saya terpaksa demi Tommy.</i>

800
00:40:46,611 --> 00:40:47,528
<i>Apa khabar Tommy?</i>

801
00:40:49,155 --> 00:40:52,158
<i>Mula tahun junior
sekolah menengah bulan depan.</i>

802
00:40:53,076 --> 00:40:55,286
<i>Dia 16 tahun dan dah ada kekasih.</i>

803
00:40:58,498 --> 00:40:59,749
<i>Ikut perangai pak ciknya.</i>

804
00:41:02,585 --> 00:41:06,005
<i>Mungkin kita boleh rancang
untuk berjumpa semasa cuti.</i>

805
00:41:11,344 --> 00:41:12,470
<i>Saya mahu.</i>

806
00:41:14,722 --> 00:41:15,765
<i>Ada doktor?</i>

807
00:41:18,601 --> 00:41:19,852
Hai, saya Dr. Abbot.

808
00:41:19,936 --> 00:41:21,229
<i>Boleh hubungi bila selesai?</i>

809
00:41:21,312 --> 00:41:23,356
Ya, tapi sekarang perlu dibedah.

810
00:41:23,439 --> 00:41:24,607
<i>Saya faham.</i>

811
00:41:25,316 --> 00:41:26,943
<i>Kita cakap lagi nanti, Howard.</i>

812
00:41:29,862 --> 00:41:31,155
<i>Lupa cakap saya sayang dia.</i>

813
00:41:33,533 --> 00:41:34,951
Wah, Monica?

814
00:41:36,035 --> 00:41:37,996
- Selamat kembali.
- Robinavitch.

815
00:41:39,539 --> 00:41:41,290
Dua untuk makmal, tiga CT.

816
00:41:41,374 --> 00:41:43,209
Biar saya hantar. Saya perlu naik.

817
00:41:43,292 --> 00:41:44,335
Sedia untuk CT.

818
00:41:44,961 --> 00:41:47,505
- Awak buat semuanya lancar.
- Masih berusaha.

819
00:41:47,588 --> 00:41:49,298
- Naik ke atas?
- Ya.

820
00:41:50,341 --> 00:41:51,300
Dia baik orangnya.

821
00:41:53,720 --> 00:41:55,430
Harap dia selamat.

822
00:42:00,685 --> 00:42:01,519
Saya suka dia.

823
00:42:03,062 --> 00:42:03,896
Melebihi saya?

824
00:42:04,689 --> 00:42:05,898
Masa akan menentukan.

825
00:42:07,025 --> 00:42:07,859
Ya?

826
00:42:08,735 --> 00:42:11,404
Ya, dia pandai
kendalikan staf dan prosedur.

827
00:42:11,487 --> 00:42:14,657
Awak serahkan syif siang
kepada orang yang tepat.

828
00:42:14,741 --> 00:42:15,616
Harap begitu.

829
00:42:16,451 --> 00:42:18,327
Okey. Saya nak balik.

830
00:42:18,411 --> 00:42:20,663
Saya kembali nanti untuk syif saya.

831
00:42:21,414 --> 00:42:22,623
Kalau tak sempat jumpa...

832
00:42:23,958 --> 00:42:25,710
- Masih nak bercuti?
- Ya.

833
00:42:26,461 --> 00:42:28,963
Rasanya awak tak pernah
bercuti lebih tiga hari.

834
00:42:29,047 --> 00:42:30,590
Saya pernah bercuti.

835
00:42:32,508 --> 00:42:33,551
Bila?

836
00:42:36,929 --> 00:42:37,847
Dah tak ingat.

837
00:42:39,932 --> 00:42:42,143
Banyak masa untuk muhasabah diri.

838
00:42:45,063 --> 00:42:46,230
Awak bolehkah?

839
00:42:49,400 --> 00:42:50,234
Okey.

840
00:42:51,527 --> 00:42:53,196
Cuma pastikan awak kembali.

841
00:42:53,696 --> 00:42:55,698
Kalau bergelut, hubungi saya.

842
00:42:57,867 --> 00:42:58,785
Dengar tak?

843
00:43:04,332 --> 00:43:05,833
Tiada retak pergelangan kaki.

844
00:43:06,501 --> 00:43:07,585
Kejap, undur balik.

845
00:43:08,836 --> 00:43:10,129
Nampak mortis normal itu?

846
00:43:10,213 --> 00:43:13,382
Ya, tapi ruang jernih tibiofibula
nampak melebar

847
00:43:13,466 --> 00:43:15,593
dan pertindihan
tibiofibula berkurang.

848
00:43:16,427 --> 00:43:17,261
Mungkin sikit.

849
00:43:20,264 --> 00:43:21,182
Lapan milimeter.

850
00:43:21,808 --> 00:43:22,767
Tiga milimeter.

851
00:43:22,850 --> 00:43:25,103
Macam koyakan ligamen sindesmotik.

852
00:43:25,603 --> 00:43:28,064
- Bukankah perlu pembedahan?
- Perlu.

853
00:43:28,147 --> 00:43:29,816
Saya boleh mohon MRI.

854
00:43:31,734 --> 00:43:33,361
Pernah buat kerja radiologi?

855
00:43:33,444 --> 00:43:35,863
Tak, saya cuma bagus.

856
00:43:39,367 --> 00:43:40,576
Saya pun bagus juga.

857
00:43:52,338 --> 00:43:55,133
Kerja yang bagus tadi, doktor.

858
00:44:01,097 --> 00:44:02,640
Panggil saya Whitaker saja.

859
00:44:02,723 --> 00:44:05,268
Tak nak. Awak dah buktikan.
Saya bangga.

860
00:44:06,102 --> 00:44:06,936
Kami semua.

861
00:44:07,895 --> 00:44:09,730
- Terima kasih.
- Sibuknya hari ini.

862
00:44:10,648 --> 00:44:11,482
Ya.

863
00:44:11,566 --> 00:44:13,860
Awak seorang yang sangat empati.

864
00:44:14,694 --> 00:44:16,404
- Ya, agaknya...
- Belum habis.

865
00:44:16,904 --> 00:44:18,865
Awak mahu sentiasa ada untuk pesakit.

866
00:44:19,448 --> 00:44:20,700
Awak tak mahu?

867
00:44:20,783 --> 00:44:22,118
- Maaf.
- Pasal hubungan

868
00:44:22,201 --> 00:44:23,578
awak dengan wanita

869
00:44:24,287 --> 00:44:26,789
iaitu balu kepada mangsa
yang mati tahun lepas?

870
00:44:27,373 --> 00:44:28,207
Amy?

871
00:44:28,875 --> 00:44:29,917
Santos beritahu?

872
00:44:30,668 --> 00:44:34,046
- Saya difahamkan awak bantu dia.
- Ya, di ladang.

873
00:44:34,130 --> 00:44:36,716
Saya membesar di ladang dan Amy...

874
00:44:37,383 --> 00:44:40,928
Pn. Miller didesak untuk jual ladang
dan saya cuma membantu.

875
00:44:42,221 --> 00:44:43,848
Bagaimana kawan dan keluarganya?

876
00:44:43,931 --> 00:44:45,016
Ya, mereka ada.

877
00:44:45,683 --> 00:44:46,517
Untuk bantu?

878
00:44:47,143 --> 00:44:50,479
Ya, rasanya mereka cuba tolong,
tapi kebanyakan masanya...

879
00:44:52,315 --> 00:44:53,399
dia harapkan saya.

880
00:44:57,153 --> 00:44:59,447
Saya pasti dia berterima kasih.

881
00:45:00,198 --> 00:45:01,699
Tapi, penting untuk ada batasan.

882
00:45:02,450 --> 00:45:03,367
Ya.

883
00:45:07,622 --> 00:45:09,207
Hei. Boleh tolong saya?

884
00:45:11,250 --> 00:45:13,461
- Ya?
- Tolong jaga rumah saya semasa cuti?

885
00:45:15,087 --> 00:45:18,799
Awak dapat bantu saya
dan jimat duit sewa.

886
00:45:20,092 --> 00:45:21,135
Awak serius?

887
00:45:21,219 --> 00:45:24,639
Tak boleh merokok, parti,
bawa haiwan atau anak.

888
00:45:24,722 --> 00:45:25,765
Awak atau orang punya.

889
00:45:26,307 --> 00:45:28,392
- Saya tiada anak.
- Dia ada.

890
00:45:29,477 --> 00:45:32,521
Saya nak minta Abbot jaga,
tapi dia buat yoga bogel

891
00:45:32,605 --> 00:45:35,274
dan rasanya jiran saya
yang tua takkan tahan.

892
00:45:37,026 --> 00:45:38,194
Ya.

893
00:45:38,277 --> 00:45:39,737
Pasti bagus.

894
00:45:40,238 --> 00:45:43,282
Hal jaga rumah,
bukan yoga bogel Abbot.

895
00:45:43,366 --> 00:45:45,409
Kalau saya tak balik,
awak ada rumah bujang.

896
00:45:45,993 --> 00:45:47,119
Okey.

897
00:45:48,996 --> 00:45:50,248
Cari saya sebelum balik.

898
00:45:50,331 --> 00:45:52,124
Saya akan beri kunci dan kod.

899
00:45:54,210 --> 00:45:55,544
Siapa yang buat?

900
00:46:00,424 --> 00:46:02,468
Kamu berdua, semak semula kerja.

901
00:46:03,094 --> 00:46:05,012
Triaj perlu bantuan.

902
00:46:05,096 --> 00:46:07,139
Princess, siapkan kerja
dan pergi ke sana.

903
00:46:07,223 --> 00:46:09,183
Tiga untuk CT. Nak saya hantar?

904
00:46:09,267 --> 00:46:10,893
Tak, ambil pesanan.

905
00:46:10,977 --> 00:46:13,020
CT akan sesak jika kita tangguh.

906
00:46:13,104 --> 00:46:15,231
Ya, tapi saya tak nak
dia buat kerja lain.

907
00:46:15,314 --> 00:46:16,691
Mana awak jumpa lembaran itu?

908
00:46:16,774 --> 00:46:19,944
Di tempat sama saya simpan
sepuluh tahun lalu.

909
00:46:20,027 --> 00:46:23,489
- Ingatkan dah rosak.
- Tak boleh terima, boleh hantar.

910
00:46:31,914 --> 00:46:34,375
Jaga hidrasi, minuman kaya elektrolit

911
00:46:34,458 --> 00:46:35,418
macam air kelapa.

912
00:46:35,501 --> 00:46:37,962
- Tak minat.
- Gatorade boleh juga.

913
00:46:38,045 --> 00:46:39,088
Elak alkohol, kafein

914
00:46:39,171 --> 00:46:41,632
dan pakai pakaian telap udara.

915
00:46:41,716 --> 00:46:43,718
- Bosan.
- Datang balik jika makin teruk,

916
00:46:43,801 --> 00:46:45,761
sakit kepala atau keliru.

917
00:46:45,845 --> 00:46:46,679
Okey.

918
00:46:48,681 --> 00:46:49,682
Awak pasti?

919
00:46:52,351 --> 00:46:53,686
Boleh kuatkan bunyi?

920
00:46:54,603 --> 00:46:58,649
<i>Pasukan kecemasan tiba
di lokasi gelongsor air runtuh</i>

921
00:46:58,733 --> 00:46:59,942
<i>di taman air tempatan.</i>

922
00:47:00,026 --> 00:47:02,153
<i>Sekurang-kurangnya seorang maut</i>

923
00:47:02,236 --> 00:47:04,280
<i>- dan mangsa cedera.</i>
- Tak guna.

924
00:47:05,281 --> 00:47:06,824
Semua akan dihantar ke sini.

925
00:47:06,907 --> 00:47:08,659
<i>...dihantar ke hospital...</i>

926
00:48:31,909 --> 00:48:33,911
Terjemahan oleh: NH Azizan

